DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270504
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270505
SUMMARY:National Teacher Appreciation Day
DESCRIPTION:National Teacher Appreciation Day falls on the Tuesday of the f
 irst full week of May\, in the middle of National Teacher Appreciation Wee
 k. It reached that spot in the calendar only in 1985\, after four decades 
 of false starts\, two single-year acts of Congress\, and a stretch in Marc
 h that almost nobody remembers. The National Education Association\, which
  sets the date\, opens its own account of the day by conceding that the or
 igins are murky.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-teacher-a
 ppreciation-day/
